lens_profiles.invalid = Khetha isizindalwazi se-Lensfun v1/v2 XML esivumelekileyo (esingedluli 8 MiB) esilemininingwane yekhamera kumbe ilensi esekelwayo.
lens_profiles.calibration = Ukulinganisa ilensi
lens_profiles.no_calibration = Akukho kulinganisa okuhambelana lalezi izilungiselelo. Hlola ubude bokugxila lesilinganiso sokusika sekhamera; ukulungisa ngesandla kusakhona.
lens_profiles.import = Ngenisa i-Lensfun XML…
lens_profiles.imported = Isizindalwazi se-Lensfun singenisiwe kulesi isikhathi sokusebenza. Khetha iphrofayili kumbe uqathanise imininingwane yesithombe.
lens_profiles.manual = Ukulungisa ngesandla kuphela
lens_profiles.saved = Ukulinganisa okulondoloziweyo (isizindalwazi asitholakali)
lens_profiles.profile = Iphrofayili yelensi
lens_profiles.aperture = Ukuvuleka kwelensi (0 = akwaziwa)
lens_profiles.distance = Ibanga lokugxila (0 = akwaziwa)
lens_profiles.vignette = Ukufiphala kwemiphetho okulinganisiweyo
lens_profiles.color_context = Ukufiphala kwemiphetho okulinganisiweyo kudinga iphrofayili ye-sRGB eyakhelwe ngaphakathi. Guqulela ku-sRGB ukuze ugcine ukubukeka, ubusuvula futhi Ukulungisa Ilensi. Kumaphikseli asevele eyi-sRGB kodwa angelalo uphawu, ukwabela i-sRGB kwanele. Ukulungiswa kwesimo lombala kusakhona.
lens_profiles.vignette_missing = Akukho kulinganisa kokufiphala kwemiphetho okuhambelana lokuvuleka kwelensi lebanga lokugxila. Faka amanani alinganisiweyo ukuze usebenzise lokhu; 1000 m imelela ukugxila kude kumaphrofayili amanengi e-Lensfun.
lens_profiles.note = Ukulungisa okulinganisiweyo kwenziwa ngaphambi kwezilawuli zesandla. Sebenzisa isithombe sokuqala esipheleleyo; usisike ngemva kwalokho. Londoloza inqwaba yezihlungi ku-PSD/PSB ukuze ukulinganisa kuqhubeke kuhleleka.
lens_profiles.automatic = Qathanisa imininingwane yesithombe
lens_profiles.components = Ukusebenza kwephrofayili: ukuhlanekezela {distortion}; imiphetho yombala {tca}; ukufiphala kwemiphetho {vignette}.
